{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sports Marketing Executive","role":"Sports Marketing Executive","summary":"A Sports Marketing Executive promotes sports teams, leagues, athletes, tournaments, venues, events and sports-related brands. The role combines sports business, marketing, sponsorships, digital media, fan engagement, brand partnerships and event promotion.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA Sports Management graduate, this is a very strong direct career pathway. The graduate can work on either side of the sports ecosystem:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Property → Fans / Audience"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brand","Sports Property","Audience"]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples of sports properties include leagues, teams, tournaments, federations, academies, venues and athlete brands."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Fresh graduates may enter as Sports Marketing Executive, Sports Marketing Associate, Marketing Executive, Sponsorship Executive, Brand Activation Executive or Sports Business Executive before progressing to Sports Marketing Manager and senior commercial roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Sports Marketing Executive / Associate"}],[{"text":"Core function"},{"text":"Marketing + sports business"}],[{"text":"Main areas"},{"text":"Sponsorships, fan engagement, campaigns, events, digital"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Creativity"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Sales/commercial skills"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Event exposure"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Not mandatory"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"High"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Sports Market